            <p style="margin: 0 0 24px 0;">Time is running out, and if you don&rsquo;t use it at <a href="{{ shop.url }}" style="color: #1990C6;">LABalloons.com</a> by <strong>October 19, 2026,</strong> you lose it.</p>

